      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðæm ðe yrfe bycgaþ.] [Ld] Ond se þe yrfe bycge on gewitnesse ⁊ hit eft tymon scyle, þonne onfó se his þe he hit ǽr ætbohte, beo he swa freoh swa ðeow, swa hweðer he sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone buys cattle in the presence of a witness, and afterwards has to vouch it to warranty, then he from whom he has bought it shall receive it back again, whether he be a slave or a freeman—whichever it be.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be ðæm ðe yrfe bycgaþ. Se ðe yrfe bycge on gewitnysse ⁊ hit eft mon teaman scyle, ðonne onfó se his ðe he hit ær ætbohte, sy swa þeow swa freoh, hweþer he sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
